WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:34.840
ONE DAY AGO

01:41.040 --> 01:44.040
Gu Yu was locked up
in Zuihua Tower at the market.

01:44.640 --> 01:47.400
All this trash was hauled from over there.

01:48.040 --> 01:49.120
Yeah.

01:49.200 --> 01:50.960
The trash from Zuihua Tower
gets dumped here.

01:57.520 --> 01:58.440
Say it again.

01:59.200 --> 02:00.880
What exactly happened that day?

02:02.000 --> 02:03.200
I saw it myself.

02:04.320 --> 02:06.600
Wang Pu and his men chained up Gu Yu

02:06.680 --> 02:08.080
and dragged him into Zuihua Tower.

02:13.400 --> 02:14.440
Say it again.

02:21.920 --> 02:23.240
Wang Pu and his men

02:23.320 --> 02:25.920
chained up Gu Yu and dragged him

02:26.520 --> 02:29.160
into Zuihua Tower like some stray dog.

02:29.680 --> 02:30.800
Say it again.

02:34.440 --> 02:35.840
Wang Pu had Gu Yu in chains.

02:36.680 --> 02:38.400
Iron chains.

02:38.480 --> 02:40.680
Two Huben men were dragging him along.

02:40.760 --> 02:42.040
His legs wouldn't move at all.

02:42.120 --> 02:44.920
His hands were gripping the chain
so tightly.

02:45.000 --> 02:46.960
The wound on his neck
could be seen so clearly.

02:47.040 --> 02:48.360
A wound on his neck?

03:06.840 --> 03:08.080
Gu Yu was hurt.

03:08.640 --> 03:10.960
There should've been bloody rags
in the trash.

03:11.880 --> 03:13.400
Used ointments and medicine

03:13.480 --> 03:15.320
would've given off a smell.

03:16.360 --> 03:17.280
No.

03:18.120 --> 03:19.960
-This isn't right.
-So

03:20.480 --> 03:23.440
taking Gu Yu to Zuihua Tower
was nothing but a diversion.

03:24.040 --> 03:25.000
What?

03:25.080 --> 03:26.160
A diversion.

03:48.720 --> 03:49.680
Huai'an,

03:50.320 --> 03:52.200
I know where they're keeping Gu Yu.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.360
It was that girl.

04:18.480 --> 04:20.079
General, who are you thinking of?

04:20.160 --> 04:23.120
Don't you think
she looks a little like you?

04:25.000 --> 04:26.440
Day in, day out together,

04:27.120 --> 04:28.680
have you started to see me differently?

04:30.320 --> 04:31.400
Of course.

04:33.840 --> 04:35.840
Your wounds are almost healed.

04:37.120 --> 04:38.720
Let me take the bandage off.

04:51.520 --> 04:52.800
It's getting late.

04:53.320 --> 04:54.960
You should rest, General.

04:57.920 --> 04:58.960
Yuan.

05:08.320 --> 05:09.280
This is for you.

05:21.360 --> 05:22.520
Thank you

05:23.360 --> 05:25.560
for taking such thoughtful care of me
these past days.

05:26.760 --> 05:28.600
But didn't you tell me

05:29.520 --> 05:31.240
that you'd grant anything I asked?

05:36.080 --> 05:37.920
I'll agree to anything you want.

05:40.640 --> 05:42.320
But first, your blade

05:43.080 --> 05:44.480
should be set aside.

05:49.960 --> 05:51.360
Don't blame me.

05:52.720 --> 05:54.000
Aren't you

05:55.040 --> 05:56.240
hiding a blade too?

06:09.560 --> 06:10.600
General.

06:12.440 --> 06:13.560
It feels like a lifetime

06:13.640 --> 06:15.240
since we last met.

06:16.520 --> 06:19.800
When word came
that His Majesty had killed you,

06:19.880 --> 06:21.760
I was the one who went to claim your body.

06:22.440 --> 06:23.560
But the body wasn't yours.

06:23.640 --> 06:26.920
Seeing you alive now isn't a surprise.

06:27.440 --> 06:30.800
What surprises me is
that we'd meet again here.

06:35.400 --> 06:36.640
White Hair,

06:38.160 --> 06:39.440
it's been a long time.

06:40.720 --> 06:44.840
You've been planning against the Huben
for quite a while, haven't you?

06:48.720 --> 06:50.320
Tonight isn't the time to reminisce.

06:50.400 --> 06:52.760
We need to think fast
and get you out of here.

06:56.480 --> 06:57.800
I'm not leaving. Not yet.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.720
Maybe it's been too long since you saw me.

07:01.400 --> 07:04.560
Perhaps you've forgotten the way I work.

07:04.640 --> 07:07.200
Maybe you forgot that I'm still a general.

07:11.000 --> 07:13.480
So many of my soldiers were slaughtered.

07:14.440 --> 07:16.680
I have to stay here.

07:16.760 --> 07:18.320
An eye for an eye.

07:18.400 --> 07:19.440
There must be vengeance.

07:24.520 --> 07:25.440
You're going to help me.

07:34.240 --> 07:35.120
Gu Yu.

07:36.240 --> 07:38.040
Wumei killed the men guarding you.

07:38.120 --> 07:41.200
From now until the bodies are found,
it's a day at most.

07:41.800 --> 07:43.520
Yan Fengshan has shown up.

07:43.600 --> 07:45.240
He's back in Chang'an.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.280
He's got at most a day.

07:48.000 --> 07:50.320
So you're going to use half a day

07:50.400 --> 07:52.920
to help me plan a way to get revenge.

07:56.960 --> 07:58.800
You can do it.

09:00.560 --> 09:02.480
Mr. Wang Pu, we should pull back.

09:22.160 --> 09:23.200
By now,

09:24.080 --> 09:25.400
Wang Pu already knows.

09:27.800 --> 09:29.280
What he doesn't know

09:30.040 --> 09:32.600
is that the Baiwenhu
will strike back at the Huben.

14:56.680 --> 14:57.520
General.

14:58.600 --> 15:00.280
The Huben Army has started moving out.

15:00.360 --> 15:01.480
We need to go.

15:15.400 --> 15:16.320
Mr. Wang!

15:32.640 --> 15:33.400
Mr. Wang!

15:36.120 --> 15:36.960
What is it?

15:37.560 --> 15:38.840
Please take a look at the market.

15:53.920 --> 15:55.040
Gu Yu.

15:55.880 --> 15:59.080
He really is a commander
you can't help but admire.

16:00.360 --> 16:02.240
A life for a life.

16:03.720 --> 16:06.680
And the one plotting for him
is a sharp mind too.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.280
Let me think.

16:15.800 --> 16:16.800
Mr. Wang,

16:16.880 --> 16:18.200
I did the same job for seven years

16:18.280 --> 16:20.040
prior to joining Hidden Soldier Alley.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.440
Sorting things is second nature.

16:21.520 --> 16:23.400
I'm quick to spot what's valuable.

16:23.480 --> 16:25.840
There's always something
worth picking up wherever I look.

16:25.920 --> 16:29.080
Digging clues out of trash.

16:30.960 --> 16:34.000
They saved Gu Yu,
and even set a trap for me.

16:35.120 --> 16:37.040
This garbage picker is the first one.

16:38.160 --> 16:39.320
Di Lu?

16:39.960 --> 16:42.280
He's been gone a long time.
He's probably dead.

16:42.800 --> 16:45.440
Then, this grey-haired one is the second.

16:46.040 --> 16:47.400
If he's the suspicious one,

16:48.080 --> 16:49.120
that means…

16:50.640 --> 16:53.080
The people you told me to check on

16:53.160 --> 16:54.840
have all been tailed.

16:56.040 --> 16:56.880
No issues.

16:57.840 --> 16:59.280
But if you're not convinced,

16:59.800 --> 17:01.160
I can just kill them all.

17:02.080 --> 17:03.800
Questioning them one by one

17:03.880 --> 17:05.560
is beyond my patience.

17:08.280 --> 17:09.640
That old witch.

17:10.560 --> 17:12.440
Aunt Xin can't be trusted either.

17:18.599 --> 17:20.920
From here on,
every word I say must be kept in mind.

17:21.760 --> 17:24.119
From West Third Alley
to West Fifth Alley, the whole area

17:24.720 --> 17:25.720
must be sealed.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.440
They'll try to break out there.

17:28.119 --> 17:28.960
Understood.

17:30.240 --> 17:31.200
Take more men.

17:31.280 --> 17:32.680
To the alley entrances.

17:33.200 --> 17:34.480
Keep an eye on that old witch.

17:35.080 --> 17:36.480
Don't you dare fight her.

17:36.560 --> 17:38.200
You may not win.

17:38.280 --> 17:40.080
-Got that?
-Got it.

17:40.160 --> 17:41.000
Move.

17:42.440 --> 17:44.680
Search all of Hidden Soldier Alley

17:45.480 --> 17:47.200
for Li Sangeng and Wang Xing.

17:49.440 --> 17:51.640
Wang Xing's real name

17:54.040 --> 17:56.400
is Xie Huai'an.

17:56.480 --> 17:57.640
Understood.

18:02.200 --> 18:03.960
You two, time to pull out.

18:04.040 --> 18:06.760
The general ordered us
to keep you both safe.

18:12.040 --> 18:13.040
It's time.

18:13.560 --> 18:14.720
Once we're out,

18:16.440 --> 18:17.800
you can become Han Ziling again.

18:35.280 --> 18:36.160
Go!

19:00.880 --> 19:03.200
Didn't expect the Huben
to react this fast.

19:03.280 --> 19:05.480
No idea whether General Gu succeeded.

19:07.520 --> 19:09.160
Most likely, he failed.

19:09.760 --> 19:11.760
The Huben's movements now are too orderly.

19:12.360 --> 19:13.760
Which means

19:13.840 --> 19:16.080
their command center
hasn't fallen into chaos.

19:16.600 --> 19:18.320
Wang Pu is still alive.

19:18.400 --> 19:20.640
His counterattack is coming our way.

19:21.640 --> 19:22.480
Move.

19:59.840 --> 20:00.680
The way ahead is full of Huben.

20:13.720 --> 20:15.880
All right. Go warn Gu Yu.

20:15.960 --> 20:17.840
Tell him this ward wall is a trap.

20:17.920 --> 20:19.000
They can't come here yet.

20:19.080 --> 20:20.560
You all break out together.

20:21.760 --> 20:23.480
You go. I'll stay.

20:23.560 --> 20:25.400
No time to argue. Hurry!

20:26.160 --> 20:27.000
Wait.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.400
You need to tell Gu Yu

20:33.360 --> 20:34.400
that we already made it out.

20:35.240 --> 20:36.280
Only after we escaped

20:36.920 --> 20:38.480
did the ward wall become surrounded.

20:39.760 --> 20:41.520
-You get me?
-I do.

20:42.320 --> 20:43.600
-Go!
-Protect the general!

20:43.680 --> 20:44.520
Yes.

20:49.800 --> 20:51.320
You two, I'm heading out.

20:51.920 --> 20:52.880
Take care.

20:52.960 --> 20:55.480
Thank you both for rescuing the general
for the Baiwenhu Army.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.960
-Hold on.
-No time to waste.

21:06.520 --> 21:07.360
Ziling.

21:08.000 --> 21:08.840
Go.

21:28.680 --> 21:30.040
With me here,

21:30.120 --> 21:33.320
it doesn't matter how many more come.

21:52.880 --> 21:54.640
I'll say it again.

21:55.240 --> 21:56.320
With me here,

21:56.400 --> 21:59.480
no number of men will make a difference.

22:12.200 --> 22:13.040
General!

22:13.120 --> 22:14.280
-General!
-General!

22:19.320 --> 22:20.520
I, Gu Yu, thank you all

22:21.160 --> 22:23.360
for avenging our fallen soldiers.

22:23.440 --> 22:24.360
We can't stay here.

22:24.960 --> 22:26.240
Let's head to the ward wall.

22:27.280 --> 22:28.120
No!

22:29.840 --> 22:30.680
General,

22:30.760 --> 22:32.680
the planned extraction point is busted.

22:32.760 --> 22:34.200
The Huben Army has it surrounded.

22:34.720 --> 22:37.680
What about Xie Huai'an, Han Ziling,
and the others meant to receive us?

22:37.760 --> 22:39.400
They've already made it out.

22:39.480 --> 22:41.600
The Huben encirclement formed
after they escaped.

22:42.360 --> 22:44.080
Mr. Xie Huai'an told me to inform you

22:44.160 --> 22:45.720
so you don't fall into the trap.

22:46.320 --> 22:47.520
Good. They're safe.

22:47.600 --> 22:49.680
We have enough men to break through.

22:54.720 --> 22:55.560
Let's move.

22:56.240 --> 22:57.320
Break out from the west wall.

22:57.400 --> 22:58.800
-Yes!
-Yes!

23:00.800 --> 23:02.520
Search thoroughly.
Leave no stone unturned.

23:02.600 --> 23:03.840
-Yes.
-Yes.

23:24.080 --> 23:25.960
Head for the southwest corner
once we get out.

23:26.040 --> 23:28.000
I pile the big trash over there.

23:28.080 --> 23:29.280
Stack the wooden crates.

23:29.360 --> 23:30.480
You can scale the wall.

23:32.080 --> 23:33.080
This is the last chance.

23:39.880 --> 23:40.720
This way.

24:57.680 --> 24:58.760
Ready.

25:05.760 --> 25:07.160
General, let's go.

25:48.800 --> 25:52.080
We've gone in circles
and ended up back here.

25:53.040 --> 25:56.120
Where it began is where it must end.

25:57.080 --> 25:58.640
I figure Di Lu

25:59.360 --> 26:01.160
wanted to drag us down with him.

26:02.440 --> 26:04.320
But Di Lu isn't even here.

26:05.280 --> 26:06.400
Right?

26:24.360 --> 26:28.000
How many soldiers
can be mobilized from Chang'an?

26:28.080 --> 26:29.360
A thousand.

26:29.880 --> 26:31.440
Before entering Hidden Soldier Alley,

26:31.520 --> 26:33.040
I ordered everyone to arm themselves.

26:33.560 --> 26:35.120
They're ready to move.

26:35.200 --> 26:37.720
You've seen how big
Hidden Soldier Alley is.

26:37.800 --> 26:41.000
A thousand men are not enough
to smash through.

26:48.200 --> 26:50.560
With this badge, you may enter the palace,

26:50.640 --> 26:52.240
and see His Majesty.

26:52.320 --> 26:54.680
Mobilize the Imperial
and Right Cavalry Guards

26:54.760 --> 26:58.520
and encircle
Hidden Soldier Alley completely.

26:58.600 --> 27:03.200
I want Xie Huai'an
and Han Ziling captured alive.

27:07.280 --> 27:10.520
I know Huai'an's tricks all too well.

27:11.480 --> 27:14.320
He always says those sentimental things,

27:14.880 --> 27:17.680
letting others take the path to life,

27:18.520 --> 27:19.600
while he walks

27:20.200 --> 27:21.520
toward the dead end himself.

27:26.640 --> 27:27.480
You

27:28.720 --> 27:29.800
lied to me.

27:31.160 --> 27:32.480
They haven't come out yet.

27:35.640 --> 27:36.880
Please forgive me, General.

27:37.520 --> 27:39.160
I blame no one.

27:41.320 --> 27:44.400
I know I have to get out of there.

27:44.480 --> 27:46.840
Tonight, in all of Chang'an,

27:46.920 --> 27:49.880
there's something more important
than anyone's life or death.

27:50.720 --> 27:52.240
But whether they live or die

27:52.960 --> 27:56.320
depends on how fast you can

27:56.400 --> 27:58.840
get His Majesty to send troops.

28:01.360 --> 28:02.520
Yes.

28:09.080 --> 28:09.920
Let's go.

28:10.840 --> 28:14.080
Take me to meet those
four distinguished guests.

28:15.240 --> 28:16.320
General,

28:16.400 --> 28:18.160
should you change clothes first?

28:18.960 --> 28:19.880
No need.

28:20.880 --> 28:22.760
If you want heads to bow,

28:22.840 --> 28:24.960
clean clothes won't do it.

28:26.760 --> 28:28.040
What matters is

28:28.560 --> 28:29.960
whether our blade

28:30.480 --> 28:31.560
is hard enough.

28:32.760 --> 28:35.320
Later on, I worried
Di Lu's body might be found.

28:35.880 --> 28:37.600
So I went back down to the cellar.

28:39.520 --> 28:41.280
But the body was already gone.

28:42.960 --> 28:44.640
Di Lu once told me

28:45.200 --> 28:48.240
that even in death,
he wanted to die in a wine jar.

28:49.240 --> 28:50.360
So later,

28:51.400 --> 28:53.920
I dug up his body and burned it.

28:54.760 --> 28:56.600
I put the ashes in a wine jar,

28:56.680 --> 28:58.640
and buried it back in the cellar.

28:58.720 --> 28:59.720
So…

29:00.720 --> 29:01.960
you were wrong.

29:05.080 --> 29:06.680
Di Lu called you a friend,

29:07.600 --> 29:08.440
and he was right.

29:11.360 --> 29:12.640
From here on,

29:14.720 --> 29:16.280
how many more must you kill?

29:22.680 --> 29:23.640
I don't know.

29:25.640 --> 29:27.120
Maybe just one.

29:30.560 --> 29:32.200
Maybe a lot more.

29:34.280 --> 29:35.400
Just one?

29:39.320 --> 29:40.400
Yan Fengshan?

29:46.240 --> 29:47.120
Yes.

29:48.600 --> 29:49.760
Can you kill him?

29:49.840 --> 29:51.000
I can.

30:00.000 --> 30:03.080
As long as he uses the travel pass
I wrote for him to enter the city,

30:04.880 --> 30:06.360
he'll be tailed.

30:06.880 --> 30:08.040
He'll walk into an ambush.

30:10.720 --> 30:12.360
And he'll end up dead.

30:22.120 --> 30:23.280
‎TRAVEL PASS

30:29.160 --> 30:30.440
The travel pass

30:30.520 --> 30:33.360
for General Fengshan to enter the city

30:35.080 --> 30:36.320
has already been sent out?

30:36.400 --> 30:37.440
Yes.

30:54.560 --> 30:55.640
Xie…

30:56.880 --> 30:57.840
Huai…

30:59.240 --> 31:00.160
An…

31:05.800 --> 31:07.440
How far is the exit

31:07.960 --> 31:09.480
in the southwest corner?

31:10.240 --> 31:11.240
It is very close.

31:11.800 --> 31:13.040
A hundred bu away.

31:13.120 --> 31:15.920
But the moment we move,
they will notice us.

31:19.040 --> 31:20.120
Think again.

31:21.160 --> 31:22.640
There must be another way.

31:23.840 --> 31:25.360
It is already a dead end.

31:26.840 --> 31:28.320
We've run out of time.

31:42.320 --> 31:43.320
No.

31:45.800 --> 31:47.920
There must still be another way.

31:52.760 --> 31:54.760
The window behind you

31:56.320 --> 31:57.800
opens to the back street.

32:00.200 --> 32:01.440
I'll go and draw the Huben away.

32:02.120 --> 32:03.200
You leave from here.

32:05.520 --> 32:07.000
I'll draw the Huben away.

32:08.600 --> 32:10.640
As long as my head stays on my neck,

32:11.800 --> 32:14.240
I'll figure out a way to save myself.

32:15.160 --> 32:17.560
Why did you make that Baiwenhu man
trick Gu Yu?

32:19.560 --> 32:20.920
Because you know

32:21.760 --> 32:24.080
there are things only Gu Yu can settle.

32:24.160 --> 32:25.040
Correct?

32:28.360 --> 32:30.880
When it's your turn,
you start playing a fool.

32:31.480 --> 32:32.920
Xie Huai'an, answer me.

32:33.000 --> 32:34.920
With all your wit,

32:36.280 --> 32:38.960
can you withstand the Huben's fists,
or outrun their blades?

32:42.600 --> 32:43.960
You've got to stay alive.

32:45.440 --> 32:47.520
Only you can bring down the Huben.

32:49.040 --> 32:51.080
If you really feel guilty,

32:51.600 --> 32:54.760
then carry my death with you
and kill Yan Fengshan.

32:57.160 --> 32:59.600
When you finally destroy the Huben,

33:00.640 --> 33:02.080
that'll count as avenging me.

33:10.240 --> 33:11.920
I've always been a scholar.

33:14.840 --> 33:17.520
To die like a hero, like a real man,

33:20.520 --> 33:21.360
is worth it.

33:26.360 --> 33:27.360
Ziling.

33:29.120 --> 33:30.120
Wait a moment.

33:31.760 --> 33:32.920
Give it one more moment.

33:38.560 --> 33:39.720
Ziling.

33:47.400 --> 33:48.800
Don't cry, Huai'an.

33:49.920 --> 33:51.680
When the day comes that you succeed,

33:52.280 --> 33:54.040
pour me a cup of victory wine.

33:54.880 --> 33:55.800
That's enough.

33:58.280 --> 33:59.120
Take care.

34:39.400 --> 34:40.280
Come on!

34:42.600 --> 34:44.159
I'm right here.

34:44.679 --> 34:46.320
I'm not hiding or running.

34:46.840 --> 34:48.480
If you want me dead,

34:49.719 --> 34:51.400
come catch me yourself.

35:27.440 --> 35:28.280
After him!

35:33.000 --> 35:34.000
Stop him!

35:49.200 --> 35:50.680
I'll run 100 bu for you.

35:52.240 --> 35:54.400
Within these 100 bu, I won't be caught.

35:55.840 --> 35:56.800
Think of this

35:58.280 --> 36:00.120
as me seeing you off.

36:51.160 --> 36:52.320
Where is Xie Huai'an?

36:55.280 --> 36:56.840
He is already out of Hidden Soldier Alley.

36:59.880 --> 37:01.160
A mere trash picker

37:02.840 --> 37:04.320
managed to fool me.

37:06.280 --> 37:07.800
I'll admit that took some skill.

37:15.440 --> 37:16.520
Tell me.

37:17.040 --> 37:18.600
What was your real name?

37:19.520 --> 37:21.040
I'll carve it on your gravestone.

37:30.600 --> 37:31.800
Han Ziling.

37:33.040 --> 37:34.440
The ling of soaring ambition.

37:37.600 --> 37:39.120
Soaring ambition.

37:43.080 --> 37:44.040
What a pity.

37:45.160 --> 37:46.400
In the end,

37:48.080 --> 37:49.520
you stank from head to toe,

37:52.120 --> 37:53.760
and died in the gutter.

37:55.360 --> 37:57.160
I've already walked the path I chose.

38:13.400 --> 38:14.680
The deposed emperor is safe.

38:15.480 --> 38:16.760
I'll tell him

38:17.640 --> 38:19.920
there was someone this stubborn

38:20.440 --> 38:21.760
who still thought of him.

